description	"Jedi Battle Master

An offense-oriented Jedi, characterized by powerful Lightsaber swings and solid Force abilities.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
-- 10% faster RoF
- Lightsaber (Yellow/Red)
-- Saber Defense (3)
-- Blaster Defense/Deflect (2)
-- 42% less Red damage
-- 25% more special damage
-- Saber Throw ^3[CS1]
--- 33% more damage

^5Force Powers:
- Jump (3)
- Push (3)
- Pull (2)
- Sense (2)
- Absorb (3) ^3[CS2]
- Speed (3) ^3[CS3]

^8Attributes:
- Heal capped at 35hp
- Force Block/Focus (2)"